# ---------------------------------------------------------------- a generic operation

markNew is operation
markNew purpose "Record an item in a set and tell whether it was new"
markNew invariant none
markNew typeParameter T plain
markNew input seen SeenItems borrowedMutable
markNew input item T copied
markNew output Bool
markNew outputOwnedBy none
markNew raises none
markNew effect none
markNew uses none
markNew memoryHeap false
markNew async false
markNew maxRecursion none
markNew label begin loopKind none
markNew label begin within none
markNew label fresh loopKind none
markNew label fresh within none
markNew label repeated loopKind none
markNew label repeated within none
markNew let yes Bool true immutable
markNew let no Bool false immutable
markNew at begin do hasItem
markNew at begin branch if present goto repeated else goto fresh
markNew at fresh do addItem
markNew at fresh return ok yes
markNew at repeated return ok no

