hasItem in markNew
hasItem invokes SeenItems.contains
hasItem argument set SeenItems seen lend
hasItem argument item T item copy
hasItem result present Bool
hasItem ownedBy none
hasItem cleanedBy none
hasItem borrows none
hasItem catch none
hasItem suppresses none

