# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the bill of materials

addOrderLine is operation
addOrderLine purpose "Expand one order line through the bill of materials and append its priced parts"
addOrderLine invariant none
addOrderLine typeParameter none
addOrderLine input lines pricing.Lines borrowedMutable
addOrderLine input totals CategoryTotals borrowedMutable
addOrderLine input sku Int64 copied
addOrderLine input quantity Int64 copied
addOrderLine input depth Int64 copied
addOrderLine output none
addOrderLine outputOwnedBy none
addOrderLine raises OrderError
addOrderLine effect none
addOrderLine uses none
addOrderLine memoryHeap false
addOrderLine async false
addOrderLine maxRecursion 8
addOrderLine label begin loopKind none
addOrderLine label begin within none
addOrderLine label countParts loopKind none
addOrderLine label countParts within none
